## DAILY MINING PROTOCOL

### CHANNEL 1: GOVERNMENT (Federal / State / Local)

**SAM.gov:**
```
SAM.gov → Contract Opportunities → Active
Filter: NAICS [partner codes]
Filter: Set-aside = EDWOSB, WOSB, Small Business
Filter: Posted within last 7 days
Keywords: [partner keywords]
```

**State Portals:**
| Portal | Partners to Match |
|--------|-------------------|
| **Michigan SIGMA** | All partners (home state priority) |
| **Kentucky VSS** | Drug testing, background, occ health |
| **Ohio** | Drug testing, NEMT, background |
| **BidNet/MITN** | All Michigan municipal |

**Cooperatives:**
| Cooperative | Partners to Match |
|-------------|-------------------|
| **Choice Partners** | Drug testing, background, courier, occ health |
| **Sourcewell** | All partners |
| **OMNIA** | Drug testing, background, medical |

**USASpending Recompetes:**
Search contracts expiring in next 6 months matching partner NAICS codes.

