## SEARCH TOOLS & METHODS

**Don't just check portals. Actively hunt.**

### Online Search Tools

| Tool | What to Search |
|------|----------------|
| **Google** | "[industry] RFP drug testing" / "[company] courier contract" |
| **LinkedIn Sales Navigator** | Lab directors, pharmacy directors, HR directors, safety managers |
| **Indeed/LinkedIn Jobs** | "RFP" "courier" "drug testing" (RFPs sometimes posted as jobs) |
| **Google Alerts** | Set alerts for partner keywords + "RFP" + "contract" |
| **Industry job boards** | Healthcare, logistics, government job boards |

### Industry Associations (Mine Their Sites)

| Industry | Association |
|----------|-------------|
| Hospitals | AHA, state hospital associations |
| Labs | COLA, AABB, ASCLS |
| Pharmacies | NCPA, APhA |
| Transit | APTA, state transit associations |
| Staffing | ASA (American Staffing Association) |
| HR | SHRM |
| Construction | AGC, ABC |
| Trucking | ATA, state trucking associations |
| Corrections | ACA, state corrections associations |
| Gaming | AGA |
| Oil & Gas | API |
| Maritime | Maritime associations |
| Nursing Homes | AHCA |
| Home Health | NAHC |

### Networking & Outreach

| Method | How |
|--------|-----|
| **Chamber of Commerce** | Local business connections, referrals |
| **Trade shows** | Healthcare logistics, HR tech, safety conferences |
| **Cold email campaigns** | Targeted outreach to industry contacts |
| **LinkedIn outreach** | Connect with decision-makers |
| **Referral asks** | Ask existing contacts for introductions |
| **Subcontracting** | SBA SubNet, prime contractor teaming |

### Publications & News

| Source | What to Watch |
|--------|---------------|
| **Industry newsletters** | Contract awards, company expansions |
| **Local business journals** | New facilities, company moves |
| **Trade publications** | Industry trends, vendor changes |
| **Press releases** | Contract announcements (who's losing = your opportunity) |

